Cell["\<\
A point drawn from every vertex makes every vertex a branch, and the \
exploration grows with the graph. Keep such scenes to small graphs; on the 3 \
\[Times] 3 grid the second point has 4 instances:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"4ba6fbee-079e-460e-85e1-76c9d89c78bb"],

